{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Service Please!</strong> is an immersive management and development simulation that follows your journey from a small startup to a massive restaurant empire. Every day, larger crowds of customers walk through your doors, your menu expands, and the workflow grows more complex\u2014all shaped by the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your business, expand your menu, manage your staff, and make the right strategic moves at the right time throughout your growth journey. Success is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/c0b8b1fd43e40fd3dd4bee5acf21ca4c.poster.avif?t=1769026536\" width=940 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/c0b8b1fd43e40fd3dd4bee5acf21ca4c.webm?t=1769026536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/c0b8b1fd43e40fd3dd4bee5acf21ca4c.mp4?t=1769026536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/2c14f85781bb408ee0f04d119c82a0fd.poster.avif?t=1769026536\" width=800 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/2c14f85781bb408ee0f04d119c82a0fd.webm?t=1769026536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/2c14f85781bb408ee0f04d119c82a0fd.mp4?t=1769026536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Own Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 