e with Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize special events based on customer demands and constantly refresh your restaurant's atmosphere.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special events for different customer groups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More revenue, more prestige.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gaming experience full of surprises that breaks the monotony.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every event brings a brand-new dynamism to your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you manage a quiet caf\u00e9 or build a bustling restaurant chain, <strong>Service Please!</strong> offers a vibrant and satisfying management experience that challenges both your strategic planning and quick decision-making skills.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669600?t=1769026536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669600?t=1769026536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/3d250ed37bb9c2d2d7a431c4c4a611011408c71a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769026536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/3d250ed37bb9c2d2d7a431c4c4a611011408c71a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769026536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Service Please!</strong> is an immersive management and development simulation that follows your journey from a small startup to a massive restaurant empire. Every day, larger crowds of customers walk through your doors, your menu expands, and the workflow grows more complex\u2014all shaped by the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_pa